		{"id":"canvas-errors","type":"text","text":"## Errors\n✓ None","x":-540,"y":-750,"width":380,"height":200,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"legend","type":"text","text":"## Legend\n🔴 **Red** = To Do (ready)\n⬜ **Gray** = Blocked\n🟠 **Orange** = Doing\n🔵 **Cyan** = Ready to review\n🟢 **Green** = Done\n🟣 **Purple** = Proposed by agent","x":-540,"y":-310,"width":380,"height":230,"color":"0"},
		{"id":"canvas-warnings","type":"text","text":"## Warnings\n✓ None","x":-540,"y":-530,"width":380,"height":200,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"3d7e31d7","type":"text","text":"## DL-01 Add logger signal validation\nValidate signals_to_log against EDMState and supported derived signals, and fail fast on unknown signals such as gap_width.","x":-60,"y":600,"width":280,"height":200,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"ce58c7a4","type":"text","text":"## DL-02 Replace broad exception swallowing\nReplace blanket exception handlers in wire/logger sync paths with targeted handling and actionable warnings.","x":-60,"y":980,"width":280,"height":220,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"4dc71a4c","type":"text","text":"## DH-03 Clean stale repository artifacts\nRemove or relocate stale backup/helper files and outdated references that create maintenance noise and onboarding confusion.","x":1760,"y":1280,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"55e9bfce","type":"text","text":"## TC-01 Add env contract and mode tests\nAdd tests that assert non-empty observations, consistent step return shapes, and robust current_mode behavior for all sampled actions.","x":800,"y":800,"width":280,"height":290,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"828f57f8","type":"text","text":"## TC-02 Add logger validation and export tests\nAdd regression tests for logger schema validation, serialization, and error paths to prevent silent data corruption.","x":480,"y":1090,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"d66aef11","type":"text","text":"## TC-03 Gate CI with coverage and lint\nExtend CI to run lint/format checks and enforce a minimum coverage threshold after core tests are in place.","x":800,"y":1440,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"6717200d","type":"text","text":"## DH-01 Align examples with controller and logging schema\nUnify controller sign convention across examples and remove/replace invalid logged signals to match the validated schema.","x":2000,"y":500,"width":280,"height":300,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"5ecc9ac5","type":"text","text":"## DH-02 Update docs for current dashboard and data flow\nRefresh README and visualization docs to reflect modular JS architecture and current supported input formats (.json/.npz/.zip).","x":1760,"y":950,"width":280,"height":280,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"28c863c6","type":"text","text":"## CR-02 Enforce valid current-mode handling\nPrevent runtime ValueError by validating/mapping current_mode inputs to modes with crater data before material removal.","x":280,"y":40,"width":280,"height":255,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"f8392039","type":"text","text":"## CR-01 Define Gym API contract (observations + reward)\nImplement stable observation_space, _get_obs payload, and non-placeholder reward semantics for training and diagnostics.","x":680,"y":-80,"width":520,"height":160,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"0486f4c3","type":"text","text":"## CR-03 Fix package version metadata lookup\nAlign __version__ resolution with the installed distribution name to avoid fallback 0.dev in production metadata.","x":280,"y":-310,"width":280,"height":250,"color":"6"}
	],
